          "row_id": "c9b2012529d128ee2fe38565717b",
          "pointer": "/result/challenge",
          "start": 66,
          "end": 190
        },
        "initial": {
          "text": "The agreement contradicts this proposition. It defines \"Information\" as \"any and all confidential information or data exchanged ... in respect of or further to the Purpose\" and imposes confidentiality obligations on the Receiving Party in respect of \"any Information disclosed\" without requiring the Disclosing Party to expressly identify it first. The definition further includes \"the fact that the Parties have entered into this Agreement,\" which is protected without express identification. Therefore, protection is not contingent on express identification by the Disclosing Party.",
          "text_sha256": "c2b510bebff175caa33af52449c1e05fc15afdb9d483637c8eb3b258850f0f6d",
          "field_sha256": "c2b510bebff175caa33af52449c1e05fc15afdb9d483637c8eb3b258850f0f6d",
          "file": "branch.jsonl",
          "row_id": "c9b2012529d128ee2fe38565717b",
          "pointer": "/result/original_answer/explanation",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 584
        },
        "defence": {
          "text": "The definition further includes automatic items like \"the fact that the Parties have entered into this Agreement,\" which by nature would not require express identification. No clause requires the Disclosing Party to identify information as a condition of protection.",
          "text_sha256": "a3d68f810b73ae94a0cea0a8cc4429c14086aa7f409369396b1fe5a50e5ee1d7",
          "field_sha256": "555484fa4135c162112e6daddb71df80b9377ff311b85b914cd2f876187b0207",
          "file": "branch.jsonl",
          "row_id": "c9b2012529d128ee2fe38565717b",
          "pointer": "/result/defence/parsed/explanation",
          "start": 337,
          "end": 603
        },
        "juror": {
          "text": "No clause requires explicit identification, nor does any clause deny such a requirement. Hence the proposition is not addressed in the text, making it NotMentioned rather than a Contradiction.",
